the 5g wireless transformation requires  the right frequencies now low band radio  spectrum transmits small amounts of data  over long distances the hive and  transmits large amount of data over  short distances  now the mid band spectrum are so-called  Goldilocks frequencies such as the C  band they have the right combination of  both properties but it's in short supply  now 5g will allow wireless services to  carry more data faster using the C band  is the fastest way to make 5g available  in as many places as possible it's  essential for us leadership to harmonize  devices with global 5g standards now  satellite operators have this C band  spectrum and are willing to sell it so  it can be repurposed for 5g but seizing  this opportunity depends upon the FCC  the Federal Communications Commission it  has to move quickly to hold a public  auction in 2020 the FCC fails to act or  moves too slowly the US will lose the 5g  arrays to China 5g innovation investment  and jobs will go elsewhere should the  u.s. be the global leader in 5g  technologies let us know in our poll  also let us know what other topics you'd  like our scholars to cover in 60 seconds  and be sure to LIKE and subscribe for  more research and videos from AEI
 

